+++ b/features/todo-persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+Feature: Persistence
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to persist across page reloads
+  So that I do not lose my task list
+
+  Rule: localStorage persistence
+
+    Scenario: Todos survive a page reload
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user adds a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user adds a todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+      And the app is reloaded
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" exists in the todo list
+      And a todo "Walk the dog" exists in the todo list
+      And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+      And the counter displays "1 item left"
diff --git a/features/todo-routing.feature b/features/todo-routing.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bdfa09a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-routing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+Feature: Routing
+  As a user
+  I want to filter my todos by All, Active, or Completed using URL hash routes
+  So that I can focus on the subset of tasks I care about
+
+  Rule: Route filtering
+
+    Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user adds a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user adds a todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user navigates to "#/"
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" exists in the todo list
+      And a todo "Walk the dog" exists in the todo list
+
+    Scenario: Active route shows only active todos
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user adds a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user adds a todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then a todo "Walk the dog" exists in the todo list
+      And a todo "Buy milk" does not exist
+
+    Scenario: Completed route shows only completed todos
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user adds a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user adds a todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user navigates to "#/completed"
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" exists in the todo list
+      And a todo "Walk the dog" does not exist
+
+  Rule: Filter link highlighting
+
+    Scenario: All filter is selected on default route
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user navigates to "#/"
+      Then the "All" filter link is selected
+
+    Scenario: Active filter is selected on active route
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then the "Active" filter link is selected
+
+    Scenario: Completed filter is selected on completed route
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+      Then the "Completed" filter link is selected
+
+  Rule: Filter persistence on item change
+
+    Scenario: Completing a todo on active route hides it immediately
+      Given the app is loaded
+      When the user adds a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user adds a todo "Walk the dog"
+      And the user navigates to "#/active"
+      And the user completes the todo "Buy milk"
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" does not exist
+      And a todo "Walk the dog" exists in the todo list
